YOUR TASK: Complete this task: Implement the baseline direct DP and brute-force validator: parse N and S; return 0 immediately if S[0] != 'B' or S[-1] != 'W'; compute p_k = number of W before the (k+1)-th black for k=1..N-1; extract records (t_j, v_j) where v_j is a newly seen p_k and v_j >= t_j; precompute factorials and inverse factorials up to N modulo 998244353; compute dp_j = -(fact[v_j] + sum_{i<j} dp_i * fact[v_j - t_i]) * invfact[v_j - t_j] mod MOD; answer = fact[N] + sum_j dp_j * fact[N - t_j] mod MOD; also implement a brute-force checker for N <= 8 enumerating all N! matchings and checking all prefix cuts, and validate the baseline on small random cases.